# Placeholder: sparkle.mp3

This file should be replaced with an actual MP3 audio file (1–2 second simple tone).

Current implementation uses Web Audio API oscillators instead of loading this file,
so this is reserved for future sound design iteration.

To generate a simple tone locally:
- FFmpeg: `ffmpeg -f lavfi -i "sine=f=800:d=0.3" -q:a 9 -acodec libmp3lame sparkle.mp3`
- Or record a simple beep using any DAW and export as MP3.

The feedback.ts module will gracefully handle missing audio files (Web Audio fallback).
